      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Submitting a support request at http://vrch.at/support will answer with this autoreply via email:\n\n```\n\nHello,\n\nThank you for reaching out. We're aware of the issue with not receiving notifications and our team is working on a permanent fix to be included in a future update.\n\nIn the meantime, as a temporary workaround, you may want to consider disabling IPv6 which has resolved this issue for other users.\n\nFor PC Users:\n\nYou can disable IPv6 by following these easy steps: How to disable IPv6.\n\nFor Meta Quest Users:\n\nIf you're using a Meta Quest, you'll likely need to switch off IPv6 from your router settings. This process can vary depending on your router model, so check the manufacturer's instructions or website for guidance.\n\nPlease try this solution and if you're still facing the same issue, don't hesitate to get back in touch with us.\n\n```",
